{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-02",
  "title": "Misunderstandings",
  "storyCode": "6-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "74c38b7eded630492d5a5d05892a93c3e188a5ba83517e174d1f75e45efe988c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oh... Rosmontis, what are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I wanna fix this terminal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Six years of memories up to last year... I saved them all in here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This morning, I went to read the log from June 12, but the screen wouldn't turn on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if... what if I can't ever read them again...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The March 14th log, when I went to the botanical gardens with daddy, or hiking in July, or the time when mommy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Mommy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "D- don't cry! Listen, you're not great with screens, right?\nWhy not wait until Scout can help you fix it? Or Closure?\nI'll take it to Closure for you. She'll fix it up lickety-split!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Scout..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is Scout that one operator who moves around all quiet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That's him! You know him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "With that perfectly polished look... like a porcelain doll."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There he is."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I had yet to hear your estimation of me. I now understand how weak it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When did you get here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You could say I have always been here. I am used to concealing myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So Mr. Scout was here all along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why didn't Blaze sense it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I... I wasn't paying attention. I just didn't notice!\nHey, if you were standing here all this time, why didn't you help her fix it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forgive me. We are mere moments from undertaking a mission. I must focus my energy on calibrating my weaponry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You might ask Closure, or the good Mechanist to assist you."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Are you about to go save Dr. {@nickname}?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oh. You're going too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "It's me we're talking about. If I didn't go, what kind of joke would Rhodes Island's elite operators be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And what did Ascalon say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "The usual. She's not going. Always there with Kal'tsit, that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did it ever occur to you... That now is perhaps not the optimal time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "But it might be our last chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Chernobog is probably going to turn back deep into Ursus to avoid that Catastrophe. And a rescue operation in the Ursus interior is going to be damn near impossible."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I keep hearing you talk about it, but is this Dr. {@nickname} really worth all this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Worth as much as Amiya and Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have I met the Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Not yet. But you will soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good. I want to know what the Doctor is like too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I really, really want to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "You will, kitten."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "By the way, Ace, there's an uninfected girl named GreyThroat on your team."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "I'm aware. She's been training in isolation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Listen, Blaze. I've been working with her for a few months now. She has trouble expressing herself, but she's not a bad person."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She looked my teammate in the eye and asked, 'How hard could it be to be Infected?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "I know. But it might have been a legitimate question to her. She might really be curious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "It's not my place to demand an operator turn her opinion on a dime. And GreyThroat has never once questioned orders."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I don't care. I'm not going to stand by and let her insult my teammates, and I sure as hell won't let her disgrace the struggle of the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Now's not the time. I can see the rage you're holding back. But really, not now."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She said it right in front of me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take a breath, Big Cat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have a task at hand yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...I do.\nFine. We'll deal with it when you get back.\nSince when is Ace more senior than me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "When you take that tone, I start to think maybe you're screwing around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She may very well be mocking you."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When he goes two days without shaving, he'll definitely look way more senior."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ace's beard is very manly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "...Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hahaha! I have to go move some stuff around. Got my own job to do, you know. Later.\nLet's get a drink when I'm done!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Try not to puke this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Misery spent two hours scrubbing the floor. I wager he would vomit himself when faced with that task again."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Who knew you could hold your liquor so well!\nRosmontis, Mechanist will give you back your terminal in a bit.\nBe a good girl and wait patiently. But don't forget either!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll definitely remember! Bye bye!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't burn yourself!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Relax. I can control my own Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "...How is it you went before me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Ace, was some uninfected girl like GreyThroat really worth training?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "How much trust did we earn? And how much trust did we give?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "If the Doctor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What are you saying over there?!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "I'm saying bad things about you. To your face."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "If there's a Doctor hanging around here, hurry up and come out already. You'll need some fancy Arts to hide behind that wall if you don't want me to find you."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "If I don't believe in Rhodes Island...?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "Then I'll string you up on a lamppost as bait for Reunion. Don't worry! You won't die. A few bolts and a knife or two never hurt anyone."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "....sigh."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Sigh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Did Amiya send you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Whatever. That's what she's best at. And what she's worst at..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "I keep trying to remind her, to get her thinking about how she's still just a kid... it always seems to have the opposite effect."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "I guess she'll never be able to put down that grown up persona of hers as long as she's the leader of Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Of course, if it wasn't Amiya who sent you, if you decided to come keep me company all by yourself, I'm not against the idea."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "...Hold me back? Haha! I could carry three of you on my back and I wouldn't even notice. One little Dr. {@nickname} can't hold me back."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Hey, look over there."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Go on! Get out of here! We don't want to fight!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Hmph... we won't yield to the Infected!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You're outnumbered! What's the point?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Duty!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Don't blame us for what happens! You see those monsters behind us? Just run already!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What monsters?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "See that Reunion group cutting through the alleys? They're picking at Lungmen's vanguard units. They won't hold for long..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Give me a path."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The usual, or...?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "The fastest, of course!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Don't give me that look. It's not like I've never carried you before."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
